/*
 * Implements semantic validation for static field access on tuple types
 * using the path operator `::`.
 *
 * Supported static fields:
 *   - init   — default tuple initializer
 *   - arity  — number of elements in the tuple
 *
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::path::tuple
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/path/tuple.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
